1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,980
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Talent shows are typically held at schools for

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,060
younger students.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,140
They allow students to be creative.

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,180
People do many different things.

5
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,340
Some students sing.

6
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,880
Some students dance.

7
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,480
Some students act.

8
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,140
Some students do magic tricks.

9
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,400
Some students play instruments.

10
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,920
Some students tell jokes.

11
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,960
Sometimes, students get more creative.

12
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,700
Some students get stage fright.

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,780
Sometimes, these students throw up.

14
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,700
But it's okay.

15
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,900
The audience cheers for them, still.

16
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,220
Kids need support.

17
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:51,440
Sometimes, talent shows have winners.

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,080
But other times, everyone is a winner.
